1
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:14,160
Good, good, good.

2
00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:14,620
Mr. Gao,

3
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:16,960
I'd like to propose a toast to you too.

4
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:17,960
Seeing you

5
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:19,280
dedicate yourself

6
00:00:19,360 --> 00:00:20,400
to these art-loving kids,

7
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:21,760
I truly admire

8
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:23,090
your great compassion.

9
00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:24,120
Let me make a promise

10
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:24,960
right here.

11
00:00:25,160 --> 00:00:26,600
As long as you'll have me,

12
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:29,840
I, Feng Shu, am willing to follow you
for the rest of my life.

13
00:00:29,840 --> 00:00:30,640
Really?

14
00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:32,360
Of course it's true.

15
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:34,680
Mr. Meng,

16
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:36,160
see that?

17
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:39,460
He's taking advantage of the situation.

18
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:40,440
No.

19
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:42,800
He is completely sincere.

20
00:00:46,520 --> 00:00:47,440
Feng Shu,

21
00:00:48,440 --> 00:00:50,800
you really need to fix

22
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:52,260
that glib tongue of yours.

23
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:55,240
Mr. Mu just said it,

24
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:56,380
sincerity.

25
00:01:04,040 --> 00:01:04,640
How was it?

26
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:07,960
You met with Yanyan, right?

27
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:09,240
I did.

28
00:01:09,960 --> 00:01:10,680
But

29
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:12,760
Yanyan said she has a boyfriend

30
00:01:12,960 --> 00:01:14,420
and warned me to stay away.

31
00:01:16,520 --> 00:01:17,760
What boyfriend?

32
00:01:17,800 --> 00:01:19,440
He's a good-for-nothing.

33
00:01:19,760 --> 00:01:20,960
I've looked into him.

34
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:23,520
He's completely worthless.

35
00:01:24,240 --> 00:01:25,600
If you're a real man,

36
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:28,240
you'll pursue her relentlessly.

37
00:01:28,240 --> 00:01:29,560
I've got your back.

38
00:01:30,600 --> 00:01:31,860
What are you afraid of?

39
00:01:32,320 --> 00:01:33,400
Hearing you say that

40
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:34,759
puts my mind at ease.

41
00:01:36,640 --> 00:01:37,700
Thank you, Mr. Gao.

42
00:01:41,880 --> 00:01:43,009
No need to see me out.

43
00:01:46,520 --> 00:01:48,320
Just enjoy your meal and drinks.

44
00:01:48,440 --> 00:01:50,100
I'll take good care of Mr. Gao.

45
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:00,800
Is everything arranged?

46
00:02:01,160 --> 00:02:02,440
Don't worry, Mr. Gao.

47
00:02:02,440 --> 00:02:03,770
It's all been arranged.

48
00:02:20,079 --> 00:02:21,410
My boss is going up soon.

49
00:02:21,440 --> 00:02:22,600
Don't let him down.

50
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:23,840
I've given you everything

51
00:02:23,840 --> 00:02:24,880
I was supposed to.

52
00:02:24,880 --> 00:02:25,680
Rest assured.

53
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:35,320
At the time,

54
00:02:36,640 --> 00:02:38,160
I followed Shen Xi's car

55
00:02:38,920 --> 00:02:40,800
to the back gate
of the thermal power plant.

56
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:41,960
I was figuring out

57
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:44,880
where to intercept her and pull her over

58
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:47,360
pretending to be a traffic cop.

59
00:02:48,040 --> 00:02:49,000
Then I saw

60
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:51,920
her hit someone.

61
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:54,200
Then why didn't you call the police

62
00:02:54,200 --> 00:02:55,160
and an ambulance

63
00:02:55,720 --> 00:02:56,800
immediately?

64
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:59,520
After all, a human life was at stake.

65
00:02:59,640 --> 00:03:00,440
I was stunned

66
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:03,890
when I saw that person
get knocked so far away.

67
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:04,840
I was stunned

68
00:03:05,200 --> 00:03:06,600
After I came to my senses,

69
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:07,680
I thought

70
00:03:08,040 --> 00:03:09,300
Shen Xi was definitely

71
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:11,600
in trouble.

72
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:13,080
I figured

73
00:03:13,720 --> 00:03:15,720
I could use the traffic cop identity

74
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:17,520
to help her clear the scene

75
00:03:18,040 --> 00:03:19,440
and comfort her.

76
00:03:20,600 --> 00:03:21,400
But

77
00:03:22,440 --> 00:03:24,040
after the scene was cleared,

78
00:03:24,440 --> 00:03:25,320
I was too embarrassed to ask

79
00:03:25,320 --> 00:03:26,600
for her number.

80
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:29,400
So I made an excuse and slipped away.

81
00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:31,780
According to Shen Xi's description,

82
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:34,120
you sounded quite convincing.

83
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:36,200
Did you study it specifically?

84
00:03:36,200 --> 00:03:37,600
Not really.

85
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:39,840
Since I drive too,

86
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:42,960
I've paid attention
to their enforcement process.

87
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:44,360
Also, I got into

88
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:46,060
a minor accident once.

89
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:48,120
The other guy rear-ended me.

90
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:49,840
He bullied me for being a novice

91
00:03:49,840 --> 00:03:51,400
and suggested settling it privately.

92
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:52,760
So we cleared the scene.

93
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:54,520
But afterwards,

94
00:03:54,920 --> 00:03:56,040
he bit back

95
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:58,050
and claimed I rolled back into him.

96
00:03:58,120 --> 00:03:59,600
If I remember correctly,

97
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:02,500
the officer handling the case

98
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:05,000
was this officer right here.

99
00:04:09,160 --> 00:04:09,820
When was it?

100
00:04:10,200 --> 00:04:11,730
About five or six years ago.

101
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:12,760
At that time,

102
00:04:13,400 --> 00:04:15,060
my dad had just bought me a car.

103
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:17,519
Officer,

104
00:04:17,839 --> 00:04:18,320
officer,

105
00:04:18,320 --> 00:04:19,120
listen to me.

106
00:04:19,519 --> 00:04:21,000
Why don't you go over there
and take a look?

107
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:22,520
It's a downhill slope.

108
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:23,720
He's a novice

109
00:04:23,720 --> 00:04:24,840
driving a manual.

110
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:27,480
Rolling back is completely normal.

111
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:29,880
Nonsense!

112
00:04:29,960 --> 00:04:31,120
I was driving perfectly fine.

113
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:33,120
You clearly lost control and hit me.

114
00:04:33,200 --> 00:04:34,880
When you got out,
you even said you were distracted

115
00:04:34,880 --> 00:04:35,520
because you argued with your wife.

116
00:04:35,520 --> 00:04:37,800
Bro, how can you just make things up?

117
00:04:38,120 --> 00:04:39,240
What does arguing with my wife

118
00:04:39,240 --> 00:04:40,960
have to do with rolling back?

119
00:04:40,960 --> 00:04:41,760
Rolling back?

120
00:04:41,880 --> 00:04:43,159
I've been driving for so many years.

121
00:04:43,159 --> 00:04:44,600
Would I roll back?

122
00:04:45,560 --> 00:04:48,000
You have the nerve to say
I'm making things up?

123
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:50,480
You clearly rear-ended me.

124
00:04:50,960 --> 00:04:52,480
You said you were in a hurry

125
00:04:52,480 --> 00:04:53,600
and wanted to settle it privately.

126
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:55,800
And now you come here to call the police.

127
00:04:56,080 --> 00:04:57,240
I see how it is now.

128
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:59,800
You're just bullying me because
I'm a newbie and don't know the rules.

129
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:01,280
You set me up on purpose.

130
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:02,760
Officer,

131
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:04,120
you have to believe me.

132
00:05:04,120 --> 00:05:05,680
Why should they believe you?

133
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:06,280
Officer,

134
00:05:06,280 --> 00:05:07,120
I'm a reporter.

135
00:05:07,120 --> 00:05:08,160
You have to believe me.

136
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:10,080
What I'm saying is definitely the truth.

137
00:05:10,080 --> 00:05:11,320
So what if you're a reporter?

138
00:05:11,320 --> 00:05:12,560
Reporters have to speak the truth too.

139
00:05:12,560 --> 00:05:14,160
What I'm saying is the truth.

140
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:16,040
You two,

141
00:05:16,640 --> 00:05:17,280
look at

142
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:18,560
the gate.

143
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:20,120
This is the traffic police brigade,

144
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:21,050
not a wet market.

145
00:05:21,320 --> 00:05:22,560
Go out the gate,

146
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:23,680
finish your argument, and then come back.

147
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:24,360
Okay, no.

148
00:05:24,360 --> 00:05:24,880
Officer,

149
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:25,880
how about this...

150
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:27,560
Let's listen to the officer.

151
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:28,000
Okay.

152
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:29,520
You're the boss.

153
00:05:29,520 --> 00:05:30,000
We'll listen to you.

154
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:30,600
Listen to me,

155
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:31,040
right?

156
00:05:31,760 --> 00:05:32,400
Good.

157
00:05:32,560 --> 00:05:34,090
I'll say this one last time.

158
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:36,800
According to the procedures
for handling road traffic accidents,

159
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:39,240
if the basic facts
of the accident cannot be

160
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:40,080
determined,

161
00:05:40,240 --> 00:05:42,640
we will issue a road traffic
accident certificate to you.

162
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:44,960
You can apply for a review, mediation,

163
00:05:44,960 --> 00:05:46,640
or file a civil lawsuit.

164
00:05:47,520 --> 00:05:48,720
See? The officer says

165
00:05:48,840 --> 00:05:50,440
it's equal responsibility.

166
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:51,800
Comrade.

167
00:05:57,200 --> 00:05:59,240
Y-Yeah, I think so.

168
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:03,000
It's been too long.
I can't remember clearly.

169
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:03,480
N-Nothing.

170
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:04,480
Please continue.

171
00:06:06,080 --> 00:06:07,400
So I thought,

172
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:09,560
if no one reported

173
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:11,170
Shen Xi's accident,

174
00:06:11,520 --> 00:06:13,080
and I did it instead,

175
00:06:13,880 --> 00:06:14,610
would it just

176
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:17,400
end up as equal liability?

177
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:20,600
But I was afraid
Shen Xi would call the police first,

178
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:21,760
so I decided

179
00:06:22,520 --> 00:06:23,980
to clear the scene for her.

180
00:06:24,080 --> 00:06:25,940
Then why did you turn yourself in?

181
00:06:26,960 --> 00:06:28,240
I really didn't expect

182
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:30,760
my good intentions to make things worse.

183
00:06:30,760 --> 00:06:32,490
It was just a traffic accident,

184
00:06:32,520 --> 00:06:33,880
but my involvement

185
00:06:34,400 --> 00:06:36,159
complicated things.

186
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:37,600
I saw everything.

187
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:41,360
You kept visiting Shen Xi,

188
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:43,610
almost driving her to depression.

189
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:46,580
She was dancing like crazy
on the balcony alone,

190
00:06:47,280 --> 00:06:48,140
and even cried.

191
00:06:48,560 --> 00:06:50,120
She cried? When?

192
00:06:50,280 --> 00:06:51,120
Last time,

193
00:06:51,640 --> 00:06:52,680
after you left.

194
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:05,800
This matter has indeed put
a lot of pressure on me.

195
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:07,920
Not to mention my car is
impounded by you guys,

196
00:07:07,920 --> 00:07:10,250
even if I had one,
I wouldn't dare to drive.

197
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:12,660
Whether I'm sleeping or dancing,

198
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:14,600
I keep seeing that accident.

199
00:07:14,680 --> 00:07:16,280
I keep seeing Mr. Gao

200
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:18,530
lunging at me covered in blood.

201
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:21,120
I'm really going crazy.

202
00:07:22,520 --> 00:07:24,280
I can understand you.

203
00:07:24,760 --> 00:07:26,120
It's inevitable for a girl

204
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:27,600
to have trauma after hitting
and killing someone

205
00:07:27,600 --> 00:07:29,560
with a car.

206
00:07:29,640 --> 00:07:30,400
If it's too much,

207
00:07:30,400 --> 00:07:32,040
find a therapist to talk to.

208
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:35,080
Thank you,

209
00:07:35,800 --> 00:07:36,659
Officer Jiang.

210
00:07:36,960 --> 00:07:37,960
You're welcome.

211
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:39,360
We should be thanking you.

212
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:40,880
Thanks for the coffee.

213
00:07:45,960 --> 00:07:47,040
So,

214
00:07:47,400 --> 00:07:49,930
that Xiao Ze lives
right across from my place.

215
00:07:52,280 --> 00:07:54,140
I really couldn't have imagined.

216
00:07:54,280 --> 00:07:55,200
My every move

217
00:07:55,200 --> 00:07:57,330
was actually being watched every day.

218
00:07:58,800 --> 00:08:00,330
It's not exactly watching.

219
00:08:00,480 --> 00:08:01,520
He just admires you,

220
00:08:01,520 --> 00:08:02,800
appreciates you, and likes you.

221
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:03,440
Anyway, he-he-he's

222
00:08:03,440 --> 00:08:05,120
not a pervert.

223
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:10,320
Ms. Shen,

224
00:08:11,200 --> 00:08:12,360
this Xiao Ze,

225
00:08:12,880 --> 00:08:15,140
he might just have
a weak sense of the law.

226
00:08:15,520 --> 00:08:17,520
He doesn't have any bad intentions.

227
00:08:17,800 --> 00:08:19,800
Including that day he followed you,

228
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:21,260
it was also to protect you.

229
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:22,640
He finally thought he had a chance

230
00:08:22,640 --> 00:08:23,680
to bump into you.

231
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:28,400
Will he be sentenced?

232
00:08:28,960 --> 00:08:30,000
That depends on

233
00:08:30,520 --> 00:08:33,320
whether the procuratorate
decides to prosecute.

234
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:35,400
If they do,

235
00:08:35,960 --> 00:08:38,159
it's up to the court
to decide the sentence.

236
00:08:38,159 --> 00:08:39,000
We can't say for sure.

237
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:40,460
Please understand, okay?

238
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:43,240
Everyone,

239
00:08:43,400 --> 00:08:46,160
based on our recent visits
and investigations...

240
00:08:46,160 --> 00:08:49,240
Including the verification of surveillance
footage around the incident area

241
00:08:49,240 --> 00:08:50,880
and the investigation into the
authenticity of the confession by Xiao Ze,

242
00:08:50,880 --> 00:08:53,680
who turned himself in and impersonated
a traffic police officer.

243
00:08:53,680 --> 00:08:54,920
At present, it can be confirmed

244
00:08:54,920 --> 00:08:56,580
that there has been no contact

245
00:08:56,800 --> 00:08:58,330
between Shen Xi and Xiao Ze.

246
00:08:58,640 --> 00:09:00,680
Based on the testimonies of Shen Xi
and Xiao Ze,

247
00:09:00,680 --> 00:09:03,080
as well as our investigation of the
accident scene,

248
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:04,740
we can basically reconstruct

249
00:09:05,400 --> 00:09:08,200
the circumstances of Gao Yuhai's
fatal accident.

250
00:09:09,520 --> 00:09:10,360
That day,

251
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:11,640
because his path was blocked by an

252
00:09:11,640 --> 00:09:13,200
abandoned, unclaimed

253
00:09:13,200 --> 00:09:15,320
old electric tricycle,

254
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:18,640
Gao Yuhai ran from the sidewalk
onto the motor vehicle lane.

255
00:09:18,640 --> 00:09:20,100
That curve is a blind spot,

256
00:09:20,160 --> 00:09:21,880
and coupled with the strong wind,
heavy rain,

257
00:09:21,880 --> 00:09:23,010
and low visibility,

258
00:09:23,400 --> 00:09:24,880
Shen Xi couldn't avoid him in time,

259
00:09:24,880 --> 00:09:26,000
resulting in the accident

260
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:27,730
that caused Gao Yuhai's death.

261
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:29,200
Currently,

262
00:09:29,560 --> 00:09:31,820
this is the result of our investigation.

263
00:09:31,880 --> 00:09:32,560
Chief Wu.

264
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:35,000
Judging from these

265
00:09:35,280 --> 00:09:36,810
investigation materials,

266
00:09:37,200 --> 00:09:39,880
the main cause was Gao Yuhai's
sudden lane change,

267
00:09:39,880 --> 00:09:41,340
which led to the accident.

268
00:09:41,560 --> 00:09:42,640
Therefore, I believe

269
00:09:42,640 --> 00:09:43,560
Gao Yuhai

270
00:09:43,720 --> 00:09:45,800
bears the primary responsibility
for the accident.

271
00:09:45,800 --> 00:09:47,320
Shen Xi, as the driver,

272
00:09:47,760 --> 00:09:49,920
bears secondary responsibility
for the accident.

273
00:09:49,920 --> 00:09:50,650
In addition,

274
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:52,960
since Gao Yuhai is deceased,

275
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:55,160
his only relative, Gao Yayan,

276
00:09:55,320 --> 00:09:57,050
hopes to wrap things up quickly

277
00:09:57,360 --> 00:09:59,280
to avoid public attention

278
00:09:59,280 --> 00:10:00,840
and false rumors.

279
00:10:00,960 --> 00:10:02,040
She has also applied

280
00:10:02,040 --> 00:10:04,560
to drop the charges against Shen Xi.

281
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:05,720
So, Li,

282
00:10:08,360 --> 00:10:09,320
your team

283
00:10:09,560 --> 00:10:11,240
should impose administrative penalties

284
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:12,520
according to the law.

285
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:14,840
We can close the case now.

286
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:15,600
Got it.

287
00:10:15,760 --> 00:10:16,360
So,

288
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:18,540
does anyone have any other thoughts?

289
00:10:19,880 --> 00:10:20,600
Then

290
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:21,730
let's wrap things up

291
00:10:22,040 --> 00:10:23,570
and close the case quickly.

292
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:35,720
This is

293
00:10:36,080 --> 00:10:36,880
way too lavish

294
00:10:36,880 --> 00:10:39,800
for a lunch.

295
00:10:40,760 --> 00:10:42,820
Technically, as public servants...

296
00:10:42,880 --> 00:10:43,880
Come on.

297
00:10:43,880 --> 00:10:45,800
You ripped me off enough
when we were kids.

298
00:10:45,800 --> 00:10:46,880
Stop pretending.

299
00:10:47,240 --> 00:10:48,160
But that was when we were kids.

300
00:10:48,160 --> 00:10:49,600
Besides, today I'm treating

301
00:10:49,600 --> 00:10:50,800
my childhood friend Li Xingchen

302
00:10:50,800 --> 00:10:52,000
and his friends.

303
00:10:52,360 --> 00:10:54,120
Right. And most importantly,

304
00:10:54,160 --> 00:10:56,520
I really need to treat
you three to a proper meal.

305
00:10:56,520 --> 00:10:58,400
You've been working so hard

306
00:10:58,520 --> 00:11:00,360
investigating my father's case lately.

307
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:01,360
Thank you.

308
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:03,280
Here, let me propose a toast.

309
00:11:03,280 --> 00:11:03,740
Cheers.

310
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:05,240
You're too kind. It's just our job.

311
00:11:05,240 --> 00:11:06,440
Thanks for your hard work, Captain Li.

312
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:07,680
It's nothing.

313
00:11:12,880 --> 00:11:13,610
Please, sit.

314
00:11:14,960 --> 00:11:16,200
Eat up. Aren't you hungry?

315
00:11:16,200 --> 00:11:16,720
I am.

316
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:17,680
Yayan,

317
00:11:17,960 --> 00:11:18,680
Have some shrimp.

318
00:11:18,680 --> 00:11:19,600
Then I'll

319
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:20,860
try this first.

320
00:11:27,760 --> 00:11:28,400
By the way,

321
00:11:28,800 --> 00:11:31,760
what's the situation with Xiao Ze?

322
00:11:33,720 --> 00:11:34,400
Him?

323
00:11:34,600 --> 00:11:36,560
He's still in the detention center.

324
00:11:36,560 --> 00:11:38,520
His family applied for bail.

325
00:11:38,880 --> 00:11:40,720
But he'll definitely
face criminal liability.

326
00:11:40,720 --> 00:11:42,560
Most likely, it'll be probation.

327
00:11:42,560 --> 00:11:43,200
But

328
00:11:43,280 --> 00:11:45,160
the final sentencing
will depend on the prosecutor

329
00:11:45,160 --> 00:11:46,920
and the court.

330
00:11:48,320 --> 00:11:49,880
Look at me, bringing this up again.

331
00:11:49,880 --> 00:11:50,680
Let's drop it.

332
00:11:50,800 --> 00:11:52,000
From today on,

333
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:53,480
we are all friends.

334
00:11:53,480 --> 00:11:54,480
Right, let's not talk about that.

335
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:56,280
Let's have another toast.

336
00:11:56,680 --> 00:11:57,280
Cheers.

337
00:11:59,520 --> 00:12:01,440
Cheers!

338
00:12:10,560 --> 00:12:11,160
Hello.

339
00:12:11,320 --> 00:12:12,580
Please blow into this.

340
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:21,800
Hello.

341
00:12:22,120 --> 00:12:23,380
Please blow into this.

342
00:12:27,480 --> 00:12:28,080
Stop!

343
00:12:28,960 --> 00:12:29,560
After him!

344
00:12:33,120 --> 00:12:33,800
Freeze!

345
00:12:33,800 --> 00:12:35,330
What are you doing? Freeze!

346
00:12:37,400 --> 00:12:38,530
Guilty conscience?

347
00:12:38,600 --> 00:12:39,480
Why run?

348
00:12:40,280 --> 00:12:41,120
It reeks of alcohol.

349
00:12:41,120 --> 00:12:42,640
How much did you drink? Let's test it.

350
00:12:42,640 --> 00:12:43,440
Take him away.

351
00:12:45,120 --> 00:12:45,760
Thanks.

352
00:12:45,920 --> 00:12:46,400
No problem.

353
00:12:46,400 --> 00:12:48,400
Captain Li, what are you doing here?

354
00:12:48,960 --> 00:12:51,080
I just finished dinner with some friends.

355
00:12:51,080 --> 00:12:51,920
We'll get back to work then.

356
00:12:51,920 --> 00:12:52,600
Good work.

357
00:12:55,280 --> 00:12:57,040
Good work, everyone.

358
00:12:57,200 --> 00:12:58,400
Just doing our job.

359
00:12:58,640 --> 00:12:59,760
Enjoy your time off, Captain Li.

360
00:12:59,760 --> 00:13:00,890
Not bad, Captain Li.

361
00:13:01,360 --> 00:13:04,420
You've got some serious arm strength
after a full meal.

362
00:13:04,760 --> 00:13:05,360
All right.

363
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:07,480
The 10.23 task force

364
00:13:07,640 --> 00:13:08,760
is officially disbanded.

365
00:13:08,760 --> 00:13:09,960
Hope we work together again.

366
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:11,640
Are you even a cop?

367
00:13:12,840 --> 00:13:14,040
Who wishes for a task force

368
00:13:14,040 --> 00:13:15,760
to reunite after disbanding?

369
00:13:15,800 --> 00:13:16,640
Aren't you afraid
of having too many cases?

370
00:13:16,640 --> 00:13:17,440
I sure am.

371
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:19,000
Yeah, Wei.

372
00:13:19,360 --> 00:13:22,040
Don't jinx it like I do.

373
00:13:22,040 --> 00:13:23,240
Knock on wood, quick.

374
00:13:25,040 --> 00:13:25,920
Knock on wood.

375
00:13:27,200 --> 00:13:28,640
Reuniting isn't impossible.

376
00:13:28,640 --> 00:13:29,760
Like we could

377
00:13:29,880 --> 00:13:30,540
grab a bite,

378
00:13:31,040 --> 00:13:31,840
sing karaoke,

379
00:13:31,880 --> 00:13:32,960
hang out,

380
00:13:32,960 --> 00:13:33,880
watch a movie,

381
00:13:34,160 --> 00:13:35,440
or have a few drinks.

382
00:13:35,440 --> 00:13:37,120
You've got a lot of ideas.

383
00:13:38,560 --> 00:13:39,520
Bye.

384
00:13:39,520 --> 00:13:41,050
Take care. Good night. Bye.

385
00:13:41,480 --> 00:13:42,200
Bye, Wei.

386
00:13:42,200 --> 00:13:42,840
Bye.

387
00:13:46,920 --> 00:13:47,760
Spit it out.

388
00:13:47,960 --> 00:13:49,560
Say whatever is on your mind.

389
00:13:50,480 --> 00:13:51,760
You caught me again.

390
00:13:52,440 --> 00:13:53,170
I just wanted

391
00:13:53,360 --> 00:13:54,560
to ask you a question.

392
00:13:54,840 --> 00:13:57,160
But you don't have to answer
if you don't want to.

393
00:13:57,160 --> 00:13:57,960
It's just...

394
00:13:58,440 --> 00:14:01,680
your relationship with
your childhood friend Song Yanfei

395
00:14:01,680 --> 00:14:03,080
isn't that simple, is it?

396
00:14:03,440 --> 00:14:04,280
Not simple?

397
00:14:05,760 --> 00:14:06,480
How is it not simple?

398
00:14:06,480 --> 00:14:08,040
No, don't...

399
00:14:08,280 --> 00:14:09,040
In what way?

400
00:14:09,040 --> 00:14:09,960
Look at you, doing it again.

401
00:14:09,960 --> 00:14:10,960
I said

402
00:14:10,960 --> 00:14:12,560
you don't have to answer
if you don't want to.

403
00:14:12,560 --> 00:14:14,040
Why are you getting worked up?

404
00:14:14,040 --> 00:14:15,300
Am I getting worked up?

405
00:14:19,280 --> 00:14:20,810
Are you done with your work?

406
00:14:22,440 --> 00:14:23,080
Yes.

407
00:14:23,400 --> 00:14:25,060
Are all the doubts cleared up?

408
00:14:27,400 --> 00:14:28,080
Doubts?

409
00:14:28,880 --> 00:14:30,040
What doubts are left?

410
00:14:30,040 --> 00:14:31,840
Our task force is done with the work.

411
00:14:31,840 --> 00:14:33,040
What else is there?

412
00:14:34,840 --> 00:14:35,760
You can't tell?

413
00:14:35,760 --> 00:14:37,160
You just can't see it.

414
00:14:37,400 --> 00:14:38,160
Pighead.

415
00:14:39,680 --> 00:14:42,740
Then... Captain Li,
what doubts are you talking about?

416
00:14:42,760 --> 00:14:43,840
Tell me,

417
00:14:44,120 --> 00:14:45,040
why did Feng Shu

418
00:14:45,040 --> 00:14:48,680
report Song Yanfei with such certainty?

419
00:14:50,040 --> 00:14:51,480
That's your doubt?

420
00:14:51,680 --> 00:14:52,560
That's why I say

421
00:14:52,560 --> 00:14:54,680
you two have an unusual relationship.

422
00:14:54,680 --> 00:14:55,800
You're looking at this based on

423
00:14:55,800 --> 00:14:57,600
personal feelings.

424
00:14:57,840 --> 00:14:58,320
Look,

425
00:14:58,560 --> 00:14:59,840
what's their relationship?

426
00:14:59,840 --> 00:15:01,600
They're rivals in love.

427
00:15:01,600 --> 00:15:02,480
What else would they do?

428
00:15:02,480 --> 00:15:04,080
Isn't it just slinging mud

429
00:15:04,080 --> 00:15:05,200
at each other?

430
00:15:05,200 --> 00:15:06,280
Slinging it back and forth.

431
00:15:06,280 --> 00:15:07,720
Just sling it first.

432
00:15:11,200 --> 00:15:12,460
Just sling it first...

433
00:15:15,760 --> 00:15:17,840
Just sling it first.

434
00:15:31,280 --> 00:15:31,880
Hello,

435
00:15:32,040 --> 00:15:32,840
hello.

436
00:15:34,200 --> 00:15:35,200
Hello, Shen Xi.

437
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:36,840
It's Xiao Ze.

438
00:15:37,600 --> 00:15:39,130
I've been released on bail.

439
00:15:39,840 --> 00:15:40,900
I'd like to see you.

440
00:15:41,280 --> 00:15:42,010
Is that okay?

441
00:15:42,840 --> 00:15:43,480
Okay.

442
00:15:44,200 --> 00:15:44,840
Welcome.

443
00:15:45,600 --> 00:15:47,000
I'll get the door for you.

444
00:15:56,960 --> 00:15:57,640
Xiao Ze,

445
00:15:57,960 --> 00:15:58,890
have some water.

446
00:16:01,040 --> 00:16:01,840
Xiao Ze,

447
00:16:02,360 --> 00:16:03,400
thank you for

448
00:16:03,880 --> 00:16:05,280
what happened last time.

449
00:16:05,400 --> 00:16:07,260
If you hadn't turned yourself in,

450
00:16:07,560 --> 00:16:09,880
I probably couldn't have
explained it clearly,

451
00:16:09,880 --> 00:16:11,610
let alone getting the car back.

452
00:16:12,400 --> 00:16:13,200
No, no,

453
00:16:13,280 --> 00:16:14,600
it was my fault.

454
00:16:15,240 --> 00:16:16,770
If I hadn't caused trouble,

455
00:16:17,240 --> 00:16:18,000
there probably

456
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:19,800
wouldn't have been so much mess.

457
00:16:19,880 --> 00:16:20,680
It's my fault.

458
00:16:21,400 --> 00:16:22,400
It's all my fault.

459
00:16:25,080 --> 00:16:25,880
Shen Xi,

460
00:16:27,760 --> 00:16:29,690
you have a really beautiful smile.

461
00:16:35,720 --> 00:16:36,320
Xiao Ze,

462
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:40,560
have you eaten?

463
00:16:41,160 --> 00:16:42,560
Let me treat you to a meal.

464
00:16:45,160 --> 00:16:45,760
Okay,

465
00:16:46,480 --> 00:16:47,480
but it's my treat.

466
00:16:47,600 --> 00:16:48,860
What do you want to eat?

467
00:16:50,560 --> 00:16:51,440
Hotpot.

468
00:16:51,680 --> 00:16:53,140
I know a really good place.

469
00:16:53,200 --> 00:16:53,840
I'll take you there.

470
00:16:53,840 --> 00:16:54,840
Let's take my car.

471
00:17:47,200 --> 00:17:49,200
Where are we going today?

472
00:17:50,200 --> 00:17:51,640
That place is too low.

473
00:17:52,640 --> 00:17:54,100
This place is out of reach.

474
00:17:54,680 --> 00:17:56,760
Let's just go to our usual spot.

